<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 175 mln mark step-down bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 175 mln mark step-down bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hypobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHKEN-UND WECHSEL BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    175 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY  **25.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-DOWN ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 25.NOV.97 THEN 3.85 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE AT PAR FROM 12.NOV.97 TO 25.NOV.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
